# Sanctioned filing, one extended regex per line (matched case-insensitively against the hit line).
# Law, "Own what you find": a standalone ticket is only an agreed deferral or tech debt outside the
# feature, after Andres's yes.
Andres('s)? yes|after his yes|waits for (Andres's|his) yes|once Andres says yes
deferrals? Andres agreed|agreed deferral
# An outreach follow-up is an email, not a ticket.
outreach-followup
